{"id":180,"name":"flaaffy","speciesId":180,"dex":180,"form":"normal","generation":2,"types":["electric"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":55,"defense":55,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":60,"speed":45},"abilities":[{"name":"static","hidden":false},{"name":"plus","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":133,"baseExp":128,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/180.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/180.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/180.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/180.ogg","genus":"Wool Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won't grow."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted."},{"version":"crystal","text":"Because of its rubbery, electric­ ity-resistant skin, it can store lots of electric­ ity in its fur."},{"version":"ruby","text":"FLAAFFY’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its fleece quality changes to generate strong static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won’t grow."},{"version":"diamond","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Not even downy wool will grow on its rubbery, nonconductive patches of skin that prevent electrical shock."},{"version":"omega-